flowchart TD
    A[POST /api/projects/] --> B[Pydantic validates user ID, project name and status]
    B -->|Invalid| C[Return 422 validation error]
    B -->|Valid| D[Project controller]
    D --> E[Project use case]
    E --> F[Find referenced user]
    F -->|Missing| G[Return 404 user not found]
    F -->|Found| H[Project repository creates project]
    H --> I[(projects table)]
    I --> J[Return 201 project response]

    K[GET /api/projects/?user_id=ID] --> L{User ID supplied?}
    L -->|Yes| M[Validate user exists and list that user's projects]
    L -->|No| N[List all projects]
    M --> O[Return project collection]
    N --> O

    P["GET, PUT or DELETE /api/projects/{project_id}"] --> Q[Find project]
    Q -->|Missing| R[Return 404]
    Q -->|Found| S[Read, update or delete through repository]

    NOTE[Current project routes do not enforce JWT ownership]
